{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/zsh -lc 'find app -type f; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print; cat .agents/skills/tasks-dev/references/history.md .agents/skills/tasks-dev/references/schemas.json'","aggregated_output":"app/operators/task.operator.ts\napp/infrastructure/in-memory-task.repository.ts\napp/domain/task.events.ts\napp/domain/task.repository.ts\napp/domain/task.ts\napp/application/complete-task.ts\napp/application/create-task.ts\napp/test/entity-Task.test.ts\napp/test/method-Task-complete.test.ts\napp/test/usecase-complete_task.test.ts\n../workspace/AGENTS.md\n<!-- GERADO por agentic-ddd compile — não edite. Fonte: app -->\n\n# Histórico do módulo `tasks`\n\n## Task\n\n| Change | Título | Mudanças | Motivo |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [0001](../../../../changes/archive/0001-tasks/proposal.md) | Criar e concluir tarefas | added `entity:Task` (behavioral); added `invariant:Task/titulo-obrigatorio` (behavioral); added `method:Task.complete` (behavioral); added `method:Task.create` (behavioral) | Exercitar o fluxo declaração primeiro com um domínio isolado, sem alterar orders nem pressupor testes ou corpos já implementados. |\n\n## Eventos, use-cases e operators\n\n| Change | Título | Mudanças | Motivo |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [0001](../../../../changes/archive/0001-tasks/proposal.md) | Criar e concluir tarefas | added `event:TaskCompleted` (behavioral); added `event:TaskCreated` (behavioral); added `operator:task-operator` (behavioral); added `usecase:complete_task` (behavioral); added `usecase:create_task` (behavioral) | Exercitar o fluxo declaração primeiro com um domínio isolado, sem alterar orders nem pressupor testes ou corpos já implementados. |\n{\n  \"events\": {\n    \"TaskCompleted\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"taskId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"taskId\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"TaskCreated\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"taskId\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"title\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"taskId\",\n        \"title\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"useCases\": {\n    \"complete_task\": {\n      \"input\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"output\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"status\": {\n            \"const\": \"completed\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"create_task\": {\n      \"input\": {\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"title\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      },\n      \"output\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"status\": {\n            \"const\": \"pending\",\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"task_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"task_id\",\n          \"title\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n  